Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 15:30:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 24/37] Small models draw charts in Graphviz DOT behind
 SEQUENCE_CHART_LANG=dot

propose_chart takes a dot digraph of file paths, compiles it with the schema's DOT compiler into
the same chart, and holds it to the same stem lookup and validator. The flag also turns on the
invented-link drop with its zero-link refusal, because the MiniCPM5 result holds only with the
repair (126 fresh answers: grounded 76% vs 43%, hop coverage 0.48 vs 0.16). Off by default;
unset, the tool the model sees is unchanged. 3 tests.
---
 packages/analyzer/src/server/askTools.ts      | 69 +++++++++++++++++-
 .../analyzer/src/test/chart-lang-dot.test.ts  | 73 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 139 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 packages/analyzer/src/test/chart-lang-dot.test.ts

diff --git a/packages/analyzer/src/server/askTools.ts b/packages/analyzer/src/server/askTools.ts
